    <h1>Computer Organisation and Design</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Third semester core course &middot; 50 sessions &middot; 6 arcs &middot; 11 decks live</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="course-pull">
  <p>A computer contains no numbers. Only voltages, and circuits built to read those voltages as numbers.</p>
  <p>A processor contains no instructions. Only circuits, and an instruction is a number that selects one of them.</p>
</div>

